    Make .gitmodules branch check work on push (#8175)
    
    The check grepped for `branch = ${{ github.base_ref }}`, but base_ref is
    only set for pull request events. On pushes the pattern degraded to
    `branch = ` and matched any three branch lines, so the check always
    passed. Fall back to the pushed branch name there, anchor the pattern so
    `develop` does not match `development`, and print what was found when
    the check fails.
    
